OCR models
----------
Text recognition uses the PP-OCRv6 small detection and recognition models. The weights are copyright
Baidu and the PaddleOCR rights holders (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), released under
Apache-2.0, and converted to ONNX and packaged by RapidOCR. RapidOCR documents this in the
MODEL_LICENSES.md file that ships inside its package.

The model files are installed with the `rapidocr` package and are not committed here. A Docker image built
from this repository contains them together with their licence files. If you redistribute them yourself,
keep those licence files and the attribution above, as Apache-2.0 section 4 requires.
